<title>USA: Rexhall Industries Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Rexhall Industries Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LANCASTER, Calif. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended March 31		1997	   1996</p>
<p> Revenue				     $17,665,000  $15,071,000</p>
<p> Net income					538,000	461,000</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>  common shares outstanding (primary)  2,725,131    2,736,328</p>
<p> Earnings per share				  .20	 .17(a)</p>
<p>(a) Originally reported as 18 cents per share on 2,606,027 shares outstanding, considering the 5 percent stock dividend paid on April 17, 1996, adjusted earnings to 17 cents per share.</p>
</text>
